<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Rules</h1>

<p>
    Swords and Ravens implements the rules of <em>A Game of Thrones: The Board Game (Second Edition)</em>,
    including the following expansions:
</p>
<ul class="list-disc list-inside my-3">
    <li>A Feast for Crows</li>
    <li>A Dance with Dragons</li>
    <li>Mother of Dragons</li>
</ul>
<p>
    We don't reproduce the full rulebooks here — please refer to the official rulebooks published by
    Fantasy Flight Games / Edge Studio for the authoritative rules text. This page will be extended
    with in-app rule clarifications and FAQs as they come up.
</p>
<p>
    For frequently asked questions, see the <a class="link link-primary" href="https://faq.swordsandravens.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FAQ</a>.
</p>
